							"top": 80,
							"width": 368,
							"height": 132,
							"text": "Lanes（泳道）- 职责划分\n\n- End User 用户交互流程\n- Data Ingestion Service 数据摄取服务\n- Stream Processing Service 实时流处理\n- Recommendation Service 推荐服务\n- Video Processing Service 视频处理服务\n- Model Training 模型训练流程\n- Monitoring Service 监控服务"
